## Parallel execution — opt-in keyword

If I say **"<KEYWORD>"**, that is explicit permission to use several subagents and/or multi-stage
orchestration — **only if** it genuinely speeds up or improves the task, otherwise work serially
with a one-line reason. It is a permission, not an obligation.

